WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.821 --> 00:00:05.160
- The CIFAR Azrieli
Global Scholars Program

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:07.620
has accelerated my
career by introducing me

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:11.170
to scholars from diverse
disciplines all over the world

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:13.240
who share many of my challenges,

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.590
but also have inspired me

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:16.650
to think about my research in new ways.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:19.400
- These meetings are often
like a who's who in the field,

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.900
and what's been very
valuable for me is that,

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:26.480
a lot of these international CIFAR Fellows

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.240
and CIFAR Global Scholars

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:31.970
have actually been the most
incisive critics of my work,

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:33.690
and that kind of opportunity

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:38.690
to engage with them in a very
friendly manner helps a lot.

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:40.180
- The unrestricted
funds that I've received

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:43.910
as a CIFAR Azrieli Global Scholar
was really valuable to me.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.210
It allowed me to pursue a
lot of high-risk directions

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:48.960
that I wouldn't be able
to pursue otherwise

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:50.200
at this stage in my career.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.530
- The mentorship
opportunities are incredible.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:56.200
You are placed in contact
with luminaries in the field

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:59.010
who will actually take
an interest in your case

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:01.780
and help you think about
how to guide your research

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:03.280
to maximum impact.

